## Proposed approach (pending approval)
1. DESeq2 on 14 samples: design ~ sex + condition; condition ref=control.
2. Upregulated DE genes in disease (FDR<0.05, log2FC threshold).
3. GO Biological Process over-representation on up genes,
   background = detected genes (expression-filtered), mapping via GENCODE csv.
4. Report most enriched process (smallest adjusted p-value with adequate gene count).

## Assumptions
- disease = ASXL1-mutant fibroblasts, control = wild-type (inferred from naming).
- No batch/pairing columns available -> ~ sex + condition.

## Uncertainties
- MGD1640F/MGD1641F metadata unknown (dropped).
- Exact enrichment definition (background, up-only vs all DE) may change result.
- Tool availability (clusterProfiler vs gseapy) depends on runtime.

## Final analysis decisions (executed)
- Dropped MGD1640F and MGD1641F (present in counts only, no coldata metadata).
- Design ~ sex + condition converged (only 2/19581 GLM fit failures); pre-agreed
  fallback ~ condition gave concordant results (LFC r=0.94), so the full design was kept.
- DE method: DESeq2-style median-of-ratios size factors + per-gene negative-binomial
  GLM (log link, statsmodels), trended (binned median) method-of-moments dispersion
  (edgeR-style), Wald test, BH FDR. Offline re-implementation (no R / no internet in runner).
- Detected background: 19,581 genes (>=10 raw counts in >=4 samples).
- Upregulated DE genes (padj<0.05, LFC>0): 1,066 (599 with LFC>=1); down: 497.
- Enrichment: GO databases were unavailable offline (no internet; clusterProfiler/
  gseapy/GOA absent), so broad biological-process classes corresponding to GO BP
  terms were defined by explicit symbol/approved-name rules (documented in
  analysis/analysis.py) and tested by one-sided Fisher exact test against the
  detected-gene background.
- Result: cell adhesion is the most enriched process among upregulated genes
  (59/306 background genes, p=1.2e-17, BH padj=1.6e-16; robust to LFC>=1 threshold:
  p=3.8e-10). Second: extracellular matrix organization (p=8.1e-6).
  Sensitivity check: the downregulated set points to a different top term
  (ECM organization, p=4.2e-8), i.e. the up-call is direction-specific.
